                                Welcome to our leadership development journey. Drawing from our recent ministry teachings and the core principles found in <em>Leadership Essentials: Shaping Vision, Multiplying Influence, Defining Character</em> by Greg Ogden and Daniel Meyer, these notes are designed to ground us as we step forward. True leadership is not about a title; it is about multiplying influence and reflecting Christ to our generation.
