                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Overcoming Leadership Deficits</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Stepping into leadership can be daunting. In our ministry gatherings, we identified five common personal and structural barriers that prevent young adults from fully embracing their call to lead:</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
                            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
                                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-300">Equipment Shortage:</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 pl-4 leading-relaxed">
                                    Feeling a lack of the necessary resources, training, or tools to execute the vision effectively.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
                                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-300">Unclear Descriptions:</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 pl-4 leading-relaxed">
                                    Operating without a clear job description, leaving roles ambiguous and goals undefined.
                                </p>
                            </div>

