                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
                                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-300">Mentorship Void:</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 pl-4 leading-relaxed">
                                    Facing a shortage of mature, available mentors to properly guide and train emerging leaders.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
