                    </div>

                    <!-- Right: The Call to Step Up & Core Principles -->
                    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6 flex flex-col">
                        <!-- The Call to Step Up -->
                        <div class="glass bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 via-cardDark to-cardDark p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border border-amber-500/20 space-y-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-amber-300">
                                <span class="text-xl">🔥</span>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">The Call to Step Up</h3>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
                                Despite these barriers, the Upper Room ministry requires young adults who are willing to bridge the gap. We cannot wait for perfect conditions or flawless mentorship to begin serving. Leadership begins with a simple, passionate willingness to be used by God right where you are.
